---
import '../styles/global.css'; import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro'; import DemoLabel from '../components/DemoLabel.astro';
const days=[32,48,39,61,54,78,67,89,73,96,82,92,77,100];
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>Creator dashboard demo · HonorCart</title></head><body class="dash-body"><header class="dash-top"><Logo/><div><DemoLabel/><span class="avatar">JS</span><span>Jordan Smith</span></div></header><div class="demo-banner"><strong>Interactive product preview</strong><span>All figures are sample data. No extension telemetry is connected.</span><a href="/creators">Learn more</a></div><div class="dash-layout"><aside><nav><a class="active" href="#overview">▦ Overview</a><a href="#identifiers">⌁ Identifiers</a><a href="#breakdown">◇ Networks</a><a href="#breakdown">□ Merchants</a><a href="#methodology">ⓘ Methodology</a></nav><div class="aside-help"><b>Transparency first</b><p>See exactly how every metric is defined.</p><a href="/transparency">Read the policy →</a></div></aside><main class="dash-main" id="overview"><div class="dash-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Creator dashboard</p><h1>Good morning, Jordan.</h1><p>Here’s how HonorCart protected your referral traffic.</p></div><select aria-label="Date range"><option>Last 30 days</option><option>Last 7 days</option><option>Today</option></select></div><div class="metric-grid four"><div><span>Protected referrals</span><b>2,418</b><small class="positive">↑ 12.4% vs prior period</small><i>Event-confirmed</i></div><div><span>Unique merchant sessions</span><b>137</b><small class="positive">↑ 8.7% vs prior period</small><i>Privacy-safe count</i></div><div><span>Checkout value observed</span><b>$94,117</b><small>Where merchant supported</small><i>Not confirmed sales</i></div><div class="estimate"><span>Potential commission</span><b>~$6,482</b><small>Estimated from rate assumptions</small><i>Not network-confirmed</i></div></div><section class="dash-card chart-card"><div class="dash-card-head"><div><h2>Protected referrals</h2><p>Daily events over the selected period</p></div><div class="legend"><i></i> Protected event</div></div><div class="chart-area"><div class="axis"><span>120</span><span>90</span><span>60</span><span>30</span><span>0</span></div><div class="bars dash-bars">{days.map((h,i)=><div><i style={`height:${h}%`}></i>{[0,4,8,12].includes(i)&&<span>{['Aug 1','Aug 9','Aug 17','Aug 25'][[0,4,8,12].indexOf(i)]}</span>}</div>)}</div></div><div class="range-tabs"><button>Daily</button><button class="active">Weekly</button><button>Monthly</button></div></section><div class="dash-two" id="breakdown"><section class="dash-card"><div class="dash-card-head"><div><h2>By network</h2><p>Matched registered identifiers</p></div></div><div class="data-list"><div><b>Impact</b><span class="meter"><i style="width:100%"></i></span><strong>1,284</strong></div><div><b>Awin</b><span class="meter"><i style="width:55%"></i></span><strong>706</strong></div><div><b>CJ</b><span class="meter"><i style="width:33%"></i></span><strong>428</strong></div></div></section><section class="dash-card"><div class="dash-card-head"><div><h2>Top merchants</h2><p>Protected sessions</p></div></div><div class="merchant-list"><div><span class="merchant-icon">N</span><b>Northstar Supply</b><strong>486</strong></div><div><span class="merchant-icon">F</span><b>Field & Found</b><strong>391</strong></div><div><span class="merchant-icon">A</span><b>Arc Goods</b><strong>284</strong></div><div><span class="merchant-icon">+</span><b>42 more</b><strong>1,257</strong></div></div></section></div><section class="dash-card" id="identifiers"><div class="dash-card-head"><div><h2>Affiliate identifiers</h2><p>Signals HonorCart uses to recognize your referrals</p></div><button class="button button-small" type="button">+ Add identifier</button></div><div class="identifier-table"><span>Network</span><span>Identifier</span><span>Status</span><span>Protected</span><b>Impact</b><code>creator_48291</code><i class="verified">✓ Verified</i><strong>1,284</strong><b>Awin</b><code>publisher_7714</code><i class="verified">✓ Verified</i><strong>706</strong><b>CJ</b><code>pid_930882</code><i class="pending">○ Pending</i><strong>428</strong></div></section><section class="method-card" id="methodology"><div>ⓘ</div><div><h2>How these numbers work</h2><p><strong>Protected referrals</strong> are recorded when HonorCart detects one of your registered affiliate identifiers and disables its own monetization. <strong>Checkout value</strong> is the displayed subtotal where supported—not confirmed sales. <strong>Potential commission</strong> is an estimate based on configured rates unless explicitly marked network-confirmed.</p><a href="/transparency">Read the full methodology →</a></div></section></main></div></body></html>
